flowchart TD
    A[Student] --> B[Streamlit UI]
    B --> C[Game engine]
    B --> D[Bug description validator]
    D -->|accepted| E[Keyword retriever]
    D -->|rejected| F[Safe error message]
    E --> G{Relevant match?}
    G -->|no| H[Ask for more context]
    G -->|yes| I[Curated bug knowledge]
    I --> J{Optional API key and opt-in?}
    J -->|no| K[Grounded template explanation]
    J -->|yes| L[LLM explanation]
    L -->|error| K
    K --> M[Explanation and suggested test]
    L --> M
    M --> N[Human verification]
    O[pytest and evaluation harness] --> C
    O --> E
    O --> D
